Subject: [PATCH] feat: let WOW_SIM_FALLBACK_FONT pin the fallback font

Without CASC fonts every WoW font maps to the first system face, which
differs between operating systems, so the same UI measures and renders
differently on macOS and Linux. WOW_SIM_FALLBACK_FONT names one font file
to use instead, for renders compared across machines such as visual
regression tests in CI. An unreadable file warns and keeps the system
fonts; unset, nothing changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
