 `WowFontSystem` (`src/render/font.rs`) loads Blizzard's fonts (`Fonts\\FRIZQT__.TTF`, ...) from CASC at startup. A font file an addon ships (`Interface\\AddOns\\<Addon>\\...`) is loaded on first use from the AddOns directories, resolved ignoring case, and keeps the weight, style and stretch of its face, so a bold file of a family renders bold. A missing addon font warns once and uses the default font.
 
+Without CASC every Blizzard font path maps to one fallback family: the font file `WOW_SIM_FALLBACK_FONT` names, else the first system face. The first system face differs between operating systems, so renders compared across machines pin the fallback.
